{%- comment -%}
  fye-guide-download — the gated PDF offer. 62 uses.

  Cover art, a short pitch, and a button that opens the guide's Klaviyo form.
  It appears near the foot of most guide pages, and on collection pages where
  the `guide` block picks the right guide for the collection being viewed.

  Setting IDs kept exactly: `band`, `cover`, `cover_alt`, `cover_caption`,
  `cover2`, `cover2_alt`, `eyebrow`, `heading`, `body`; per `button` block
  `label`, `link`, `klaviyo_form`, `style`; per `guide` block `match`, `hide`,
  `cover`, `cover_alt`, `cover2`, `cover2_alt`, `eyebrow`, `heading`, `body`,
  `button_label`, `trigger`, `link`, `style`.

  TWO WAYS TO USE IT, and the second is why this section is 13KB in the old
  theme rather than 3KB:

  1. SECTION SETTINGS — one fixed guide. The section's own cover, heading and
     body, with `button` blocks under it. This is what the guide pages use.

  2. `guide` BLOCKS — collection-aware. Each block carries a `match` string;
     the FIRST block whose `match` appears in the current collection handle,
     page handle or template wins, and its content replaces the section's.
     That is how one section on the collection template offers the engagement
     guide on /collections/engagement-rings and the wedding guide on
     /collections/wedding-rings. A block with `hide` set is skipped, and a
     block with an empty `match` is the fallback for everything else.

  If any `guide` block matches, the section settings are ignored entirely —
  they are the no-blocks case, not a set of defaults to merge with.

  `cover2` is the second cover shown fanned behind the first where a guide has
  a two-book set. Purely decorative, so it carries an empty alt.

  The button opens a popup via `data-fye-popup`, carrying either `klaviyo_form`
  (button block) or `trigger` (guide block) — both are kept because both are in
  use. A `link` wins over either, for a guide that has a real download page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign band = s.band | default: 'mist'

  comment
    Work out the winning guide block. Matched against the collection handle
    first, then the page handle, then the template name — most specific first.
  endcomment
  assign haystack = ''
  if collection.handle != blank
    assign haystack = haystack | append: collection.handle | append: ' '
  endif
  if page.handle != blank
    assign haystack = haystack | append: page.handle | append: ' '
  endif
  assign haystack = haystack | append: template.name | append: ' ' | append: template.suffix

  assign chosen = nil
  assign fallback = nil
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type != 'guide'
      continue
    endif
    if block.settings.hide
      continue
    endif
    if block.settings.match == blank
      if fallback == nil
        assign fallback = block
      endif
      continue
    endif
    if chosen == nil and haystack contains block.settings.match
      assign chosen = block
    endif
  endfor
  if chosen == nil
    assign chosen = fallback
  endif

  comment
    Resolve the content once, from whichever source won, so the markup below
    reads the same either way.
  endcomment
  if chosen
    assign g = chosen.settings
    assign eyebrow = g.eyebrow
    assign heading = g.heading
    assign body = g.body
    assign cover = g.cover
    assign cover_alt = g.cover_alt
    assign cover2 = g.cover2
    assign caption = s.cover_caption
  else
    assign eyebrow = s.eyebrow
    assign heading = s.heading
    assign body = s.body
    assign cover = s.cover
    assign cover_alt = s.cover_alt
    assign cover2 = s.cover2
    assign caption = s.cover_caption
  endif

  comment
    Layout and second-cover labelling always come from the SECTION, never the
    guide block: it is a presentation choice for the page, not part of a
    guide's content.
  endcomment
  assign layout = s.covers_layout | default: 'fan'
  assign cover2_alt = s.cover2_alt
  assign caption2 = s.cover2_caption
-%}

<section class="gdl band band--{{ band }}" data-screen-label="Guide download">
  <div class="wrap gdl__inner{% if layout == 'side' and cover2 != blank %} gdl__inner--side{% endif %}">

    {%- if layout == 'side' and cover2 != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        SIDE BY SIDE. Both guides are real, distinct products, so each cover
        gets its own caption and its own alt — no aria-hidden, no rotation.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gdl__covers gdl__covers--side">
        {%- if cover != blank -%}
          <div class="gdl__book">
            <div class="gdl__cover">
              {{ cover | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag:
                 loading: 'lazy', widths: '200,300,450,700', sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 40vw, 186px',
                 alt: cover_alt }}
            </div>
            {%- if caption != blank -%}
              <p class="fine gdl__caption">{{ caption }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="gdl__book">
          <div class="gdl__cover">
            {{ cover2 | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag:
               loading: 'lazy', widths: '200,300,450,700', sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 40vw, 186px',
               alt: cover2_alt }}
          </div>
          {%- if caption2 != blank -%}
            <p class="fine gdl__caption">{{ caption2 }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="gdl__covers{% if cover2 != blank %} gdl__covers--pair{% endif %}">
        {%- if cover != blank -%}
          <div class="gdl__cover">
            {{ cover | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag:
               loading: 'lazy', widths: '260,400,600,800', sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 60vw, 300px',
               alt: cover_alt }}
          </div>
          {%- if cover2 != blank -%}
            {%- comment -%} Decorative second cover, fanned behind. {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="gdl__cover gdl__cover--back" aria-hidden="true">
              {{ cover2 | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag:
                 loading: 'lazy', widths: '260,400,600,800', sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 60vw, 300px',
                 alt: '' }}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if caption != blank -%}
          <p class="fine gdl__caption">{{ caption }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="gdl__words">
      {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="gdl__heading">{{ heading }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if body != blank -%}
        <div class="gdl__body">{{ body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="row gdl__actions">
        {%- if chosen -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign g = chosen.settings
            assign variant = ''
            if g.style == 'btn--outline'
              assign variant = ' btn--outline'
            endif
          -%}
          {%- if g.button_label != blank -%}
            {%- if g.link != blank -%}
              <a class="btn{{ variant }}" href="{{ g.link }}" {{ chosen.shopify_attributes }}>{{ g.button_label }}</a>
            {%- else -%}
              <button type="button" class="btn{{ variant }}" data-fye-popup="{{ g.trigger }}" {{ chosen.shopify_attributes }}>{{ g.button_label }}</button>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type != 'button' -%}{% continue %}{%- endif -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign b = block.settings
              assign variant = ''
              if b.style == 'btn--outline'
                assign variant = ' btn--outline'
              endif
            -%}
            {%- if b.label != blank -%}
              {%- if b.link != blank -%}
                <a class="btn{{ variant }}" href="{{ b.link }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ b.label }}</a>
              {%- else -%}
                <button type="button" class="btn{{ variant }}" data-fye-popup="{{ b.klaviyo_form }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ b.label }}</button>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .gdl__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
  gap: var(--s10);
  align-items: center;
}
.fye .gdl__covers { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s4); }
.fye .gdl__cover :where(img) { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; }

/* The pair: the second cover sits behind and slightly out, so the front one
   still reads as the guide being offered.

   NOT z-index: -1 — that puts it behind the BAND's background rather than
   behind its sibling, and the second cover vanished completely. The wrapper
   makes the stacking context; the two covers layer inside it. */
.fye .gdl__covers--pair { padding-inline-start: var(--s6); isolation: isolate; }
.fye .gdl__covers--pair .gdl__cover { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.fye .gdl__covers--pair .gdl__cover--back {
  position: absolute;
  inset-block-start: 0;
  inset-inline-start: 0;
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 0;
  transform: rotate(-4deg) translate(-6%, 2%);
}
.fye .gdl__caption { margin: 0; }

.fye .gdl__words { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s4); }
.fye .gdl__body { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 56ch; }
.fye .gdl__actions { margin-top: var(--s3); }

/* ---- side by side: both guides visible and named ------------------------ */

/* 420px, not 320: two 3:4 covers inside 320px would be ~150px each, too small
   to read a guide's title on. */
.fye .gdl__inner--side { grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr; }
.fye .gdl__covers--side {
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--s6);
}
.fye .gdl__book { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s4); }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fye .gdl__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s7); }

  /* Centred, and 200px rather than 240. In a one-column layout a cover pinned
     left leaves an empty half-width beside it that reads as a missing element,
     and 240px of a ~330px content width makes the cover the subject of the
     band instead of the thing being offered. */
  .fye .gdl__covers { max-width: 200px; margin-inline: auto; align-items: center; }
  .fye .gdl__caption { text-align: center; }

  /* The pair stays side by side — two covers in a row is the whole point — but
     capped and centred. Left to stretch, each cover would land near 150px,
     which is the size the desktop column was widened to avoid. */
  .fye .gdl__inner--side { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .fye .gdl__covers--side {
    max-width: 300px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    gap: var(--s5);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .fye .gdl__book { align-items: center; }

  /* The words stay left-aligned: centred body copy is harder to read, and the
     brand sets body copy left. Only the art and its labels centre. */
  .fye .gdl__words { align-items: flex-start; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Guide download",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Free download" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The Engagement Ring Guide" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Text" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Cover" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "cover", "label": "Cover" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cover_alt", "label": "Cover description" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cover_caption", "label": "Caption" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "cover2", "label": "Second cover" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cover2_alt", "label": "Second cover description", "info": "Used in side-by-side layout only." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cover2_caption", "label": "Second caption", "info": "Side-by-side layout only." },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "covers_layout", "label": "Two covers", "default": "fan",
      "info": "Side by side when both guides are distinct and a customer needs to know both exist.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "fan",  "label": "Fanned behind (decorative)" },
        { "value": "side", "label": "Side by side, both labelled" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Background" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "band", "label": "Background", "default": "mist",
      "options": [
        { "value": "mist",  "label": "Mist" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Ivory" },
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "teal",  "label": "Teal" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "button",
      "name": "Button",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Download guide" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link", "info": "Wins over the popup when set." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "klaviyo_form", "label": "Klaviyo form ID" },
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "style", "label": "Style", "default": "btn",
          "options": [
            { "value": "btn",          "label": "Filled" },
            { "value": "btn--outline", "label": "Outline" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "guide",
      "name": "Guide (chosen by page)",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Add one block per guide. The first whose match text appears in the collection handle, page handle or template wins, and replaces the section's own content. Leave the match empty for a fallback." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "match", "label": "Match text", "info": "e.g. engagement — matched against the collection or page handle." },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "hide", "label": "Skip this guide", "default": false },
        { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Free download" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Text" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "cover", "label": "Cover" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "cover_alt", "label": "Cover description" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "cover2", "label": "Second cover" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "cover2_alt", "label": "Second cover description", "info": "Not used — decorative." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Download guide" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "trigger", "label": "Popup trigger", "default": "open-engagement-ring-guide" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link", "info": "Wins over the popup when set." },
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "style", "label": "Style", "default": "btn",
          "options": [
            { "value": "btn",          "label": "Filled" },
            { "value": "btn--outline", "label": "Outline" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Guide download", "blocks": [{ "type": "button" }] }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
